Copyright 2026 ALT-VoiceType contributors

This product includes software and, in its Windows installers, third-party
model weights.

Source repository:
- The Git repository does not contain model weights. Users who run from source
  obtain them from the upstream repositories and remain responsible for
  complying with each license.

Release installers:
- The full Windows installers published in GitHub Releases bundle model weights
  so the application can run offline.
- The bundled models are listed in THIRD_PARTY-MODELS.md, together with their
  upstream links and license notes.
- The application code is Apache-2.0. The model weights are not relicensed as
  Apache-2.0 merely because they are distributed alongside Apache-2.0 code.
- Before commercial redistribution, verify the exact checkpoint card and its
  current upstream terms.

Runtime / library components:
- PySide6 / Qt (LGPL-3.0) — dynamically linked Qt bindings, if the UI extra is installed.
- PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause) — CPU ASR runtime bundled in the current installers.
- Transformers, tokenizers, huggingface_hub, safetensors, accelerate (Apache-2.0).
- faster-whisper (MIT) — English ASR adapter; model weights have separate terms.
- CTranslate2 (MIT) — faster-whisper runtime.
- onnxruntime (MIT) — faster-whisper dependency.
- PyAV / FFmpeg (BSD-style / LGPL or GPL depending on the FFmpeg build) — audio decoding.
- NumPy (BSD-3-Clause).
- librosa (ISC), numba/llvmlite (BSD-2-Clause/BSD-3-Clause) — audio loading.
- hf_xet (Apache-2.0) — resumable model downloads.
- sounddevice (MIT) — microphone capture.
- llama.cpp (MIT) — bundled CUDA local LLM runtime.
- sherpa-onnx (Apache-2.0) — optional CPU ASR runtime.
- qwen-asr (Apache-2.0), Qwen team — Qwen3-ASR inference.

Bundled models (full installers; see THIRD_PARTY-MODELS.md):
- Qwen3-ASR-0.6B (Apache-2.0; verify the checkpoint card).
- Qwen3-1.7B-Abliterated Q4 (derived from Qwen3-1.7B, Apache-2.0; verify the
  derivative model card).
- Index-Translate-2B Q4 (repository code Apache-2.0; model weights may have
  separate terms — check the model card).
- faster-whisper small.en (English installer; faster-whisper code is MIT; model
  card terms apply).

This NOTICE is informational and does not replace the upstream license texts.
